   <p><note place="header">170</note></p>
<p><date when="1861">1861</date> Executive Journal</p>
<p><date when="1861-02-05">Feby 5</date> 
<lb/>The <persName ref="cwgk:N00000258">Governor</persName> approved an account of $21. to <persName ref="cwgk:N00001598">E H Tole</persName> for work done in <orgName ref="cwgk:O001020">House of Representatives</orgName> certified as correct by the <persName ref="cwgk:N00003205">Sergeant at Arms</persName></p>
<p>He commissioned <persName ref="cwgk:N00020584">E. B. Pope</persName> and <persName ref="cwgk:N00020585">J. M. Berill</persName> Colonel and Lieutenant Colonel of the <orgName ref="cwgk:O00020743">Enrolled Militia</orgName> for the <placeName ref="cwgk:P00005027">County of Washington</placeName>.</p>
<p>Also the Captains, First, Second, &amp; Third Lieutenants of the <placeName ref="cwgk:P00002675">Todd County</placeName> <orgName ref="cwgk:O00020742">Enrolled Militia</orgName> duly elected</p>
<p>He pardoned <persName ref="cwgk:N00007747">John H. Gabmill</persName> convicted of Felony by the <orgName ref="cwgk:O00000487">Perry Circuit Court</orgName> and sentenced to two years confinement in the <orgName ref="cwgk:O00000266">Penitentiary</orgName></p>
<p>He caused to be filed the Oath of office of <persName ref="cwgk:N00002347">Sam<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">l</hi></hi> S. Carter</persName> Com<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">r</hi></hi> of Deeds fo <placeName ref="cwgk:P00001140">Massachusetts</placeName>.</p>
<p>He appointed <persName ref="cwgk:N00007376">Ja<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">s</hi></hi> S. Phelps</persName> a Manager of the <orgName ref="cwgk:O00002422">Western Lunatic Asylum</orgName> in place of <persName ref="cwgk:N00018779">Jno. S. Bryan</persName> resigned.</p>
<p>He nominated to the <orgName ref="cwgk:O001019">Senate</orgName> the following persons to be Notaries Public in the counties named, to wit:</p>
<p><persName ref="cwgk:N00002350">J. D. Jones</persName> and <persName ref="cwgk:N00002351">A. C. Martin</persName> for <placeName ref="cwgk:P00001174">Boyd</placeName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00002352">F. T. Fox</persName> for <placeName ref="cwgk:P00002353">Boyle</placeName> <persName ref="cwgk:N00001906">Rob<hi rend="sup">t</hi> N. Winn</persName> for <placeName ref="cwgk:P001786">Clarke</placeName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00001879">W. A. Piner</persName> and <persName ref="cwgk:N00000844">Geo. B. Hodge</persName> for <placeName ref="cwgk:P00001874">Campbell</placeName> <persName ref="cwgk:N00002354">F W. Alexander</persName>. for <placeName ref="cwgk:P001829">Cumberland</placeName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00002391">John Hogan</persName> for <placeName ref="cwgk:P00000682">Carroll</placeName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00013861">W<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">m</hi></hi> B. Wall</persName> for <placeName ref="cwgk:P001811">Daviess</placeName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00002393">Ja<hi rend="sup">s</hi> W. Cochran</persName> for <placeName ref="cwgk:P001031">Fayette</placeName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00002394">Tho<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">s</hi></hi> P. Wherritt</persName> for <placeName ref="cwgk:P001011">Garrard</placeName> <persName ref="cwgk:N00002395">W<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">m</hi></hi> Owens Jr</persName>. for <placeName ref="cwgk:P00000905">Hickman</placeName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00002396">Geo T. Beatty</persName> &amp; <persName ref="cwgk:N00002397">L. H. Lyne</persName> for <placeName ref="cwgk:P00002891">Henderson</placeName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00002299">L H Rousseau</persName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00002300">Robt A Watts</persName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00001250">John B. Bell</persName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00001909">Jo<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">s</hi></hi> A. Hamilton</persName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00001849">H. V. Sanders</persName> <persName ref="cwgk:N00001781">R. H. Higgins</persName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N001782">A. M. Gazlay</persName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N002041">Ja<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">s</hi></hi> Chambers</persName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00002399">D. W. Wilson</persName> <persName ref="cwgk:N00002400">W. H. Beymoth</persName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00002401">Ja<hi rend="sup">s</hi> Harrison</persName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N002029">W. G. Reasor</persName> <persName ref="cwgk:N00002402">B. D Kennedy</persName> <persName ref="cwgk:N00002403">W. Marriner</persName> <persName ref="cwgk:N00002404">A. M Stout</persName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00002405">Cha<hi rend="sup">s</hi> Franke</persName> <persName ref="cwgk:N00000977">W. F Bullock</persName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00009428">Ja<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">s</hi></hi> J. Dozier</persName> <persName ref="cwgk:N00002407">B. L. M<hi rend="sup">c</hi>Dougall</persName> <persName ref="cwgk:N00002408">H. C. Pindell</persName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00002419">Conrad Shroeder</persName> and <persName ref="cwgk:N00002420">Fredk. Frishe</persName> for <placeName ref="cwgk:P001005">Jefferson</placeName> <persName ref="cwgk:N00015205">Jno. C Herndon</persName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00002410">T. A Flanagan</persName>. <persName ref="cwgk:N00006549">James Ayars Jr</persName>. and <persName ref="cwgk:N00000459">Jno. P. Harrison</persName> for <placeName ref="cwgk:P00000937">Kenton</placeName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00002058">Jo<hi rend="sup">s</hi> Harris Jr.</persName> and <persName ref="cwgk:N00002411">L A. Fuqua</persName> for <placeName ref="cwgk:P00000909">M<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">c</hi></hi>Cracken</placeName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00001729">I R Lambroth</persName> for <placeName ref="cwgk:P00000445">Muhlenberg</placeName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00002412">A. Ryder</persName> for <placeName ref="cwgk:P00002413">Marion</placeName>. <persName ref="cwgk:N00002414">W<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">m</hi></hi> W. Howard</persName> for <placeName ref="cwgk:P00000539">Nicholas</placeName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00002415">J. W. Muir</persName> and <persName ref="cwgk:N00002416">E Edwin M<hi rend="sup">c</hi>Kay</persName> for <placeName ref="cwgk:P001012">Nelson</placeName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00002021">W<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">m</hi></hi> H. Nall</persName> for <placeName ref="cwgk:P00002417">Ohio</placeName> <persName ref="cwgk:N00002418">Jno. R. Robinson</persName> for <placeName ref="cwgk:P00000681">Taylor</placeName>. <persName ref="cwgk:N00002035">W. P. Hays</persName> for <placeName ref="cwgk:P001020">Warren</placeName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00001848">A. C. M<hi rend="sup">c</hi>Elroy</persName> for <placeName ref="cwgk:P00005027">Washington</placeName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00002308">G. C. Gaines</persName> <persName ref="cwgk:N00017535">W. F. Vaughan</persName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00002309">H. L Woolfork</persName> and <persName ref="cwgk:N00001060">John Brooks</persName> for <placeName ref="cwgk:P00002312">Webster County</placeName>. which nominations are duly confirmed</p>
<p>He approved and signed enrolled bills Chapters from 24 to 49 inclusive.<pb/></p>
<p><note place="header">171</note></p>
<p><date when="1861">1861</date> Executive Journal</p>
<p><date when="1861-02-05">Feby 5</date>
